  "region_id": "ap-southeast-3",
  "paths": {
    "/rest/vdc/v3.0/capacity/{vdc_id}/statics": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "查询VDC资源概览",
        "x-resource": "配额管理",
        "description": "查询VDC资源概览。\n\ncurl命令调用示例:\n```\ncurl -i -H \"Accept: application/json\"  -H \"x-auth-token: ******\" -X GET \"https://{endpoint}/rest/vdc/v3.0/capacity/113f4394-2f54-472f-b03f-aacbd98f9cb4/statics?inherit=true\"\n```\n\n|SLA项|定义|\n|-----|-----|\n|请求成功率| >=99.9%|\n|可用性|Tier1|\n|数据一致性|最终一致,不一致时长<1分钟|\n|吞吐量|60次/分钟|\n|吞吐量|20次/秒|\n|TP50请求时延|1500ms|\n|TP99.9请求时延|3000ms|",
        "x-precautions": "错误码:当请求不成功时,响应体内的错误码信息请参见“ManageOne 运营面API参考 > 错误码说明 > VDC特性”章节。",
        "tags": [
          "VDC"
        ],
        "operationId": "CountVDCResources",
        "produces": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "consumes": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "x-auth-token",
            "in": "header",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "description": "接口支持的用户token。运营管理员,VDC管理员权限,vdc只读权限用户的token。"
          },
          {
            "name": "vdc_id",
            "in": "path",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 64,
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "description": "VDC ID,只能包含小写字母、数字、中划线,长度在1-64之间。"
          },
          {
            "name": "inherit",
            "type": "boolean",
            "required": true,
            "in": "query",
            "description": "是否包含子集VDC资源统计信息,当需要统计子集VDC资源时该值为true(仅限一级VDC ID),否则为false。"
          },
          {
            "name": "cloud_infra_type",
            "type": "string",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "资源池类型。"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
